    "body": "## Summary\n\nRemoves the public symbols that were marked deprecated in v4.5.0, now that `main` is the v5 clean-break trunk:\n\n- **`deriveSecret` / `deriveBlindingFactor`** (NUT-13) — replaced by `deriveSecretAndBlindingFactor`, which derives both values for a counter in one call.\n- **`Wallet.completeMelt` boolean `preferAsync` overload** — callers pass `{ preferAsync: true }` on the `CompleteMeltOptions` object instead. The two overloads collapse back into a single signature.\n\nMigration steps are documented in `migration-5.0.0.md`.\n\n## Motivation\n\nBoth symbols completed a full deprecation cycle: they shipped marked deprecated in v4.5.0 with documented replacements. v5 is the major where removed/renamed API is dropped, so this clears them from the public surface.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `src/crypto/NUT13.ts` — remove `deriveSecret` and `deriveBlindingFactor`.\n- `src/wallet/Wallet.ts` — drop the boolean overload; single `completeMelt(meltPreview, privkey?, options?: CompleteMeltOptions)` signature.\n- `etc/cashu-ts.api.md` — regenerated.\n- Tests that consumed the removed helpers derive the single values locally / pass the options object.\n- `migration-5.0.0.md` — two new migration sections.",
